  m_text: "Scan a flat, well-lit surface with your device. \n\nWhen enough area is
    detected, tap Start. \n\nEnemies will spawn and move toward you\u2014shoot them
    before they reach you.\n\nTap an element button to switch projectiles.\n\nChoose
    the right element for extra damage:\n\u2022 Fire beats Nature\n\u2022 Water beats
    Fire\n\u2022 Nature beats Water\n\nEnemies become faster every minute.\n\nYou
    have 3 lives - the game ends when all lives are lost."
